('sec301_forced_labor', '%', 'AR', 10, 'ad_valorem', 'Section 301 of the Trade Act of 1974, as amended (19 U.S.C. 2411); USTR determinations at 91 Fed. Reg. 34272 (June 2, 2026); final action notice, Federal Register 2026-15181 (July 28, 2026)', '2026-07-24', NULL, '["See USTR Annexes I-II for full product exemption list (raw materials, economy-wide disruption risk, unavailable domestic substitutes) -- not encoded line-item in this app."]', 'Additional duty is layered on top of Column 1 General (or USMCA/other special) rate and any Section 232 overlay; Section 301 List 1-4 China duties (if applicable) stack separately. Applies broadly across HTS Chapters 1-97 except goods covered by Annex I/II exemptions (raw materials, economy-wide-disruption-risk categories, goods with no domestic substitute) -- this app has NOT encoded the Annex I/II exemption HTS list at line-item granularity; treat any Chapter 1-97 product from a listed economy as presumptively in scope and flag for manual annex check.', 'https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/07/28/2026-15181/notice-of-actions-in-section-301-investigations-of-acts-policies-and-practices-of-various-economies', 1, '2026-09-22', '2026-09-22'),
